DialogX [SimTalk]
Sets the position on the x-axis where Plant Simulation shows the dialog box of the Dialog designated by
<Path>.
Remarks
The unit is a pixel.
The zero point is the top left corner of the screen or the dialog box.
Type
Attribute
Syntax
<Path>.DialogX:integer
Assignment Value
You can assign a value of data type integer.
Specify -1 for either DialogX or DialogY to center the Dialog on screen.
Example
MyDialog.DialogX := 350 
SimTalk
